                                "sense_id": "b167a3e9-3dd0-31d1-954d-6e9d69a69595",
                                "text": "\"When you get burned once,\" Markham continued, \"as I did in 'Second Hundred Years' ... where I got my wazoo shot off ...\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e73453b5-7001-4cf4-aff6-d3b4e7b7db12",
                                "sense_id": "b167a3e9-3dd0-31d1-954d-6e9d69a69595",
                                "text": "“He's doing it wrong! I am much more suave, debonair, and sophisticated than that!” “Yes, Dan, that's a very debonair stain you have on your shirt.” “I'll have you know I have sophistication coming out the wazoo!”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9347187-efe7-37f8-a964-eec1bcb7cf84",
                        "entry_id": "1f968218-fcd4-3096-9027-c51155e2136a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A horrible person; an arsehole."
