                                "sense_id": "f9347187-efe7-37f8-a964-eec1bcb7cf84",
                                "text": "Even now, in the spring, the river softly cries, 'Menthol, Menthol, you are one wazoo. One day I'm the elf next door and the poof I'm a river.'"
                            }
